Z||000000||FieroMaster88||11-08-2001||09:25 PM||||Hello all.  My ignition module went south this week.  We replaced it with an old one off of my friends Fiero(still works), but I was wondering if there were any "performance" ignition modules that are good to use, or if I should just buy a factory module?  Any info would be greatly appreciated!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Thanks!<BR>[Edit] Forgot to mention...this is on the V6 I installed! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">[Edit]<P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jamessig.jpg">                    <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>Not your ordinary 88 coupe!<p>[This message has been edited by FieroMaster88 (edited 11-08-2001).]||||reg||1
